	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salus et vita per dominum Iesum, etc.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Literae tuae 19. huius mensis datae<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Nicht erhalten.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>hodie mihi redditae sunt per tabellarium hunc publicum<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Unbekannt. Wohl ein mit dem Briefverkehr zwischen <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName> und <placeName ref="l257">Konstanz</placeName> beauftragter Bote, der auch <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Brief an <persName ref="p8354">Frölich</persName> vom 18. Juni (<ref target="file12511">Nr. 2464</ref>) von <placeName ref="l257">Konstanz</placeName> nach <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName> befördert hatte; s. <ref target="file12510">Nr. 2463</ref>,1-3.</note>, qui intra <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>duas iterum discessurum se dicit horas.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Volui ergo pauca haec ad <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>tuas respondere.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Non enim opus repetere omnia ea, quae iam binis literis<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Briefe <ref target="file12509">Nr. 2462</ref> (vom 17. Juni) und <ref target="file12514">Nr. 2467</ref> (vom 20. Juni).</note> <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ad te copiosius intra aliquot scripsi dies, quarum utrasque interea <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>te accepisse spero.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Sicut ergo in illis scribi, ita se adhuc res habet.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Magnus <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>inter divites tremor.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Vulgus eorum impatientissime fert <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>fugam,<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Vgl. <ref target="file12509">Nr. 2462</ref>,25f, und <ref target="file12518">Nr. 2471</ref>,45f.</note> ita ut nihil in praesentiarum magis quam vulgi metuam <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>impetum.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p18538">Imperator</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> 22. iunii <persName ref="p3730">legatum</persName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Der kaiserliche Gesandte <persName ref="p3730">Lazarus Schwendi</persName> wurde am 21. (nicht am 22.) Juni vom <placeName ref="l18">Augsburger</placeName> Rat empfangen; s. <bibl source="b373">Lenz</bibl> III 522; <hi>Roth, <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName></hi> III 344f und Anm. 23. Er überbrachte ein kaiserliches Schreiben vom 17. Juni, das ebenfalls an <placeName ref="l513">Ulm</placeName>, <placeName ref="l491">Straßburg</placeName> und <placeName ref="l361">Nürnberg</placeName> abgeschickt wurde <hi>(<persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName> BW</hi> II 496- 500, Nr. <hi>554; RTA-JR</hi> XVII 453-457, Nr. 80; Kopie in Zürich StA, A 177, Nr. 3; zu diesem Schreiben s. ferner aaO, A 205/1, <ref target="file10245">Nr. 214</ref>). <persName ref="p3730">Schwendi</persName> beförderte diesen Brief auch nach <placeName ref="l513">Ulm</placeName> und <placeName ref="l491">Straßburg</placeName>; s. Adolf <hi>Warnecke,</hi> Diplomatische Thätigkeit des Lazarus von Schwendi im Dienste Karls V., Einbeck 1890, S. 9-11; <ref target="file12529">Nr. 2482</ref>, Anm. 3. -Die <placeName ref="l18">Augsburger</placeName> antworteten dem Kaiser mit einer Gesandtschaft, die schon am 22. in <placeName ref="l410">Regensburg</placeName> eintraf; s. <hi>Roth, <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName></hi> III 346; <bibl source="b658">Viglius van Zwichem</bibl> 4. 20-22. 24 und Anm. 29. 31. 38. Am 26. Juni verfassten sie ebenfalls einen Brief an den Kaiser; s. <hi><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName> BW</hi> II 508, Nr. 558.</note> habuit coram senatu <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>nostro, qui valde conquestus est nomine caesareae maiestatis, quid sibi velint apparatus <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>illi urbium bellici, cum tamen nullam hactenus senserint eius <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>inclementiam; rogare itaque se, ut desistant et quieti sint.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Sibi enim quosdam <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>imperii principes hactenus inobedientes in animo esse in obedientiam redigere.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Urbibus eum omnino bene velle.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Praeterea propter religionem neminem se velle <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>affectare.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">His et similibus dolis nostros voluit placare, sed sen<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>atus noster, qui, quid subsit, olfacit, pergit munire urbem militibus.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Castra extra urbem parantur subsidiariis<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Zu den Kriegsvorbereitungen in <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName> s. <bibl source="b304">Herberger, Schertlin</bibl> LXXXIII; <hi>Roth, <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName></hi> III 352.</note>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Populus vulgaris fortis <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>est omnino,<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. aber <ref target="file12509">Nr. 2462</ref>,10f, und <ref target="file12514">Nr. 2467</ref>.31: <hi>Roth, <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName></hi> III 350f. Roth bezeugt aber auch, dass im letzten Drittel des Monats Juni die Stimmung der Bevölkerung besser wurde; s. aaO, S. 352.</note> sic et concionatores plaerique.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Ago autem tibi, mi pater, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>gratias maximas pro doctissima illa paraclesi<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Diese tröstliche Ermunterung wird wohl Teil des nicht erhaltenen Briefes von <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> an <persName ref="p8018">Haller</persName> gewesen sein; s. oben Z. 1f.</note>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Praestabo me virum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>christianum, <placeName ref="l862">Helvetium</placeName> et, quam possum, praebebo me exemplum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>fortitudinis et animositatis omnibus<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Vgl. oben <ref target="file12509">Nr. 2462</ref>, Anm. 19.</note>.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Pugnabo indesinenter <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>invocando nomen domini<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Röm 10, 13</ref></cit>.</note>, qui est turris fortitudinis<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><cit type="bible"><ref>Ps 61 (Vulg. 60), 4</ref></cit>.</note> nostrae, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>speroque confudendos<pb type="edition" next="117"/> et lacerandos esse, qui lapidem hunc oneris <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>levare conabuntur,<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><cit type="bible"><ref>Sach 12, 3</ref></cit>.</note> quorum forte tandem implebitur iniquitas<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Gen 15, 16</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Apk 18. 5</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Quodsi vero quid patiendum propter nomen domini,<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Apg 9, 16</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Apk 2, 3</ref></cit>.</note> sit nomen <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>domini benedictum<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Phil 1, 29</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Si enim hactenus bona suscepimus de manu <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>domini, mala autem cur non sustineamus<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17"><cit type="bible"><ref>Hi 2, 10</ref></cit>.</note>?</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Domini sum, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>sive vivam, sive moriar<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18"><cit type="bible"><ref>Röm 14, 8</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Ille mihi vita est et mori lucrum<note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19"><cit type="bible"><ref>Phil 1, 21</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Non itaque me quicquam movent hae turbę.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Dominus hunc in me <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>conservet spiritum!</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Scio nobis in mundo nihil expectandum quam afflic<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>tiones; laetor autem et exulto in eo, qui vicit mundum,<note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20"><cit type="bible"><ref>Joh 16, 33</ref></cit>.</note> sciens, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>quod merces nostra copiosa futura sit in coelis<note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21"><cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 5, 12 par</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Adiuva autem <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>tu nos una cum reliquis fratribus praecando flectere deum, ne tradat <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>haereditatem suam in manus impiissimorum horum idololatrarum,<note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" n="22">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Ez 7, 21</ref></cit>.</note> ne <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>forte dicant: ’ubi est deus eorum?’,<note xml:id="fn23" type="footnote" n="23">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Ps 79 (Vulg. 78), 10</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>115 (Vulg. 113), 2</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Jo 2, 17</ref></cit>.</note> sed ut ostendat, quod ipse solus <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>sit deus et praeter eum non sit alius<note xml:id="fn24" type="footnote" n="24"><cit type="bible"><ref>Dtn 32, 39</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>De <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiis</placeName> miror, <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>quod nihil scripseris.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Scio enim nostros eorum implorare opem <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>suppliciter.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Credo profecto caesarem mutaturum consilium, si au<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>diret eos nobis auxiliaturos.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Hortare ergo, ne desint his, quorum <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>etiam ipsos pessundaret interitus<note xml:id="fn25" type="footnote" n="25">Vgl. <ref target="file12509">Nr. 2462</ref>,20-23.</note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale meque cum omnibus piis <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>domino per preces tuas commenda.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te d. <persName ref="p2336">Bernhardinus</persName><note xml:id="fn26" type="footnote" n="26"><persName ref="p2336">Bernardino Ochino</persName>.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z43"/><persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName>,<note xml:id="fn27" type="footnote" n="27"><persName ref="p8417">Wolfgang Musculus</persName>.</note> <persName ref="p1860">Cellarius</persName><note xml:id="fn28" type="footnote" n="28"><persName ref="p1860">Michael Keller</persName>.</note> et <persName ref="p18636">Heldius</persName><note xml:id="fn29" type="footnote" n="29"><persName ref="p18636">Johann Heinrich Held von Tiefenau</persName>, Pfarrer an St. Ulrich in <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName>; s. <hi>Roth, <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName></hi> III 537. 541.</note> iam mecum coenaturi.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z44"/>Saluta vicissim fratres omnes et socerum meum<note xml:id="fn30" type="footnote" n="30"><persName ref="p5413">Ulrich Kambli</persName>, Zunftmeister in <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</note>, quem, ne nimium <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>pro nobis<note xml:id="fn31" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="31">Gemeint sind <persName ref="p8018">Haller</persName>, seine Frau <persName ref="p5131">Elsbeth, geb. Kambli</persName>, und ihr Kind <persName ref="p20735">Agnes</persName>.</note> sollicitus sit, hortare, cum is, qui optimus maximus est, pro <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>nobis sit sollicitus<note xml:id="fn32" type="footnote" n="32"><cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 6, 26</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z47"/>25. iunii anno 1546.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z48"/><persName ref="p8018">Ioan. Hallerus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z49"/>tuus ex animo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>viro d. <persName ref="p495">Bullin<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>gero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurin<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ae</placeName> ecclesiae fidelissimo <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>doctori, do<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>mino suo colendo, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>m. <persName ref="p495">Heinrich <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>Bullinger</persName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>